    "description": "<h1>General Information</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Description and Objectives of the Community Cluster \"Research Software Engineering (RSE)\" approved as part of NDFI4Objects in April 2023</p>\n<p><em>Beschreibung und Zielsetzung des im Rahmen von NDFI4Objects im April 2023 beschlossenen Community Clusters \"Research Software Engineering (RSE)\"</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h1>Communication</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Current information about and collaboration in this Community Cluster via the following RocketChat channel: <a href=\"https://n4o-chat.nfdi.de/channel/CC_ResearchSoftwareEngineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://n4o-chat.nfdi.de/channel/CC_ResearchSoftwareEngineering</a></li>\n<li>Aktuelle Informationen zu und Mitarbeit in diesem Community Cluster &uuml;ber folgenden RocketChat-Kanal: <a href=\"https://n4o-chat.nfdi.de/channel/CC_ResearchSoftwareEngineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://n4o-chat.nfdi.de/channel/CC_ResearchSoftwareEngineering</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Konstituierende Sitzung / Inaugural Meeting</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>24.01.2024, 14.00 AM CET, Zoom Link will be announced in the RocketChat channel</p>\n</blockquote>",
